be%22%5D%2C%22channelId%22%3A%22UCGcBOP3IhbgHOPBcUFUZRdQ%22%2C%22isOwnerViewing%22%3Afalse%2C%22shortDescription%22%3A%22We+all+have+our+own+unique+money+logic.+With+the+Wells+Fargo%C2%AE+Mobile+App%2C+it%E2%80%99s+easy+for+Oliver+to+track+his+savings.+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5CnLearn+more+at+https%3A%2F%2Fwelcome.wf.com%2Fmoneysmart%2F%3Ffocus%3Dsavings%5Cu0026utm_campaign%3D26_pcm_cons_uf_en%5Cu0026utm_source%3Dyoutube%5Cu0026utm_medium%3Dorganicvideo%5Cu0026utm_content%3Doliversavings15+%5Cn+%5CnTranscript%3A+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BVideo+Overview%3A+Promotion+for+Wells+Fargo+Consumer+Banking%2C+specifically+the+ability+to+track+savings+goals+in+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app.+This+video+features+a+man%2C+Oliver%2C+eating+a+sandwich+in+his+parked+car+outside+the+stadium+as+spectators+walk+in+around+him.+Oliver+reminds+himself+that+he%E2%80%99s+saving+up+for+his+%E2%80%98Playoffs+fund%E2%80%99+which+is+why+he+opts+to+eat+before+the+game+to+save+money.%5D++%5Cn++%5Cn%5BWe+open+on+a+man%2C+Oliver%2C+in+a+car.+He%E2%80%99s+eating+a+delicious+looking+gourmet+sandwich+with+mozzarella+and+prosciutto+on+focaccia.%5D+%5Cn++%5CnVO%3A+To+Oliver%2C+eating+here+instead+of+buying+a+stadium+hot+dog%2C+is+like+putting+away+20+bucks.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOliver+picks+up+his+phone.+He+has+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app+open+with+his+%E2%80%98Playoffs+fund%E2%80%99+savings+goal+opened.+He+has+saved+%24580+so+far+and+still+has+%241%2C420+to+go+to+reach+the+%242%2C000+goal+he+has+set+for+himself.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+disclosure%3A+%5Cn++%5CnScreen+images+simulated.+Availability+may+be+affected+by+your+mobile+carrier%E2%80%99s+coverage+area.+Message+and+data+rates+may+apply.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+With+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app%E2%80%A6tracking+his+savings+is+simple.+%5Cn++%5Cn%5BOliver+looks+to+his+friends+outside+and+a+tiny+bit+of+arugula+and+pesto+falls+out+of+the+sandwich+and+onto+his+lap.%5D+%5Cn++%5CnVO%3A+Whoops.++%5Cn++%5Cn%5BOliver+looks+down+and+wipes+it+