m+hot+dog%2C+is+like+putting+away+20+bucks.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOliver+picks+up+his+phone.+He+has+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app+open+with+his+%E2%80%98Playoffs+fund%E2%80%99+savings+goal+opened.+He+has+saved+%24580+so+far+and+still+has+%241%2C420+to+go+to+reach+the+%242%2C000+goal+he+has+set+for+himself.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+disclosure%3A+%5Cn++%5CnScreen+images+simulated.+Availability+may+be+affected+by+your+mobile+carrier%E2%80%99s+coverage+area.+Message+and+data+rates+may+apply.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+With+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app%E2%80%A6tracking+his+savings+is+simple.+%5Cn++%5Cn%5BOliver+looks+to+his+friends+outside+and+a+tiny+bit+of+arugula+and+pesto+falls+out+of+the+sandwich+and+onto+his+lap.%5D+%5Cn++%5CnVO%3A+Whoops.++%5Cn++%5Cn%5BOliver+looks+down+and+wipes+it+off.%5D+%5Cn+++%5Cn%5BWells+Fargo+Sonic+Logo%5D+%5Cn++%5Cn%5BOn+screen+Disclosure%3A+%5CnWells+Fargo+Bank%2C+N.A.+Member+FDIC.%5D%22%7D%2C%22lengthSeconds%22%3A16%2C%22ownerProfileUrl%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40wellsfargo%22%2C%22externalChannelId%22%3A%22UCGcBOP3IhbgHOPBcUFUZRdQ%22%2C%22isFamilySafe%22%3Afalse%2C%22availableCountries%22%3A%5B%22AD%22%2C%22AE%22%2C%22AF%22%2C%22AG%22%2C%22AI%22%2C%22AL%22%2C%22AM%22%2C%22AO%22%2C%22AQ%22%2C%22AR%22%2C%22AS%22%2C%22AT%22%2C%22AU%22%2C%22AW%22%2C%22AX%22%2C%22AZ%22%2C%22BA%22%2C%22BB%22%2C%22BD%22%2C%22BE%22%2C%22BF%22%2C%22BG%22%2C%22BH%22%2C%22BI%22%2C%22BJ%22%2C%22BL%22%2C%22BM%22%2C%22BN%22%2C%22BO%22%2C%22BQ%22%2C%22BR%22%2C%22BS%22%2C%22BT%22%2C%22BV%22%2C%22BW%22%2C%22BY%22%2C%22BZ%22%2C%22CA%22%2C%22CC%22%2C%22CD%22%2C%22CF%22%2C%22CG%22%2C%22CH%22%2C%22CI%22%2C%22CK%22%2C%22CL%22%2C%22CM%22%2C%22CN%22%2C%22CO%22%2C%22CR%22%2C%22CU%22%2C%22CV%22%2C%22CW%22%2C%22CX%22%2C%22CY%22%2C%22CZ%22%2C%22DE%22%2C%22DJ%22%2C%22DK%22%2C%22DM%22%2C%22DO%22%2C%22DZ%22%2C%22EC%22%2C%22EE%22%2C%22EG%22%2C%22EH%22%2C%22ER%22%2C%22ES%22%2C%22ET%22%2C%22FI%22%2C%22FJ%22%2C%22FK%22%2C%22FM%22%2C%22FO%22%2C%22FR%22%2C%22GA%22%2C%22GB%22%2C%22GD%22%2